    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Is your daily life like a copy and paste, or are you just standing still? Liang Shuang says that curiosity and desire for knowledge are the rewarding mechanism of life. Those who are keen to ‘try and see’ are easily favoured by the God of Luck; and those who have suffered losses, injuries and tears know how to treat life more gently. Walking your own path, taking risks and not being afraid to cross boundaries will help you live an upgraded version of yourself. The way you spend your day is the way you spend your life; every day that you live with your heart is the best years of your life</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
